cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Outcome labels for platinum-response prediction in TCGA-OV: code, analysis outputs and patient-level label table"
version: 2.0.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.20802753
date-released: "2026-11-04"
authors:
  - family-names: Chintala
    given-names: Aaron Michael Anuroop
    affiliation: "George Mason University, School of Systems Biology"
abstract: >
  Code, analysis outputs and a versioned patient-level label table for a study of
  the coverage, agreement and provenance of candidate platinum-response labels in
  489 platinum-treated TCGA ovarian cancer patients: TCGA's published platinum
  status, a platinum-free interval re-derived from the TCGA Clinical Data Resource,
  first-course response, and overall-survival thresholds evaluated as candidate
  surrogates. Includes the manuscript source, supporting information and figures.
  Release v1.0.0 (10.5281/zenodo.20802754) is the earlier expression classifier
  that this release supersedes.
keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - machine learning
  - ovarian cancer
  - RNA-seq
  - TCGA
  - feature selection
  - data leakage
  - reproducibility
